        // of the game's curve, leaving the gun away from a point 15 u off it (26.25 from V5)
        // rolled round the aim, each a grey core of 43 at FIX 0x4F in a blue glow 3-5 times
        // as wide at 0x1A, jittered 0.2 a frame, the ends showing one after another. As it
        // spits two rings of 61 grow out from the muzzle over 15 frames, and while it lasts
        // 0x2C glows sparkle there (0x322C20); where an arc strikes, 20 dark smokes and 20
        // blue embers (0x321580). Marked targets take the shared bolt (the defaults'
        // "bolt"). Not drawn: the charge's arcs at the gun while held (0x321CB8), arcs cut
        // short with smoke where they meet a wall, the bolt it also throws 10 u ahead as it
        // spits, its light and glare; the rings show on a release at marks too, where the
        // game's don't.
