        // The Shield Charger (0x3410E8; effects.md, "Shield Charger") [code]: at each enemy
        // it zaps, no line but eight pairs of sparkles (0x342DB8) shrinking away, one in the
        // shield's colour by level and one white; the game's are on its shell toward the
        // enemy, the kit's at the enemy. While it is up, its shell (0x342098): a dome turned
        // to the camera 0.9 u round in 21 at alpha 0x18, blended, and a ring of 11 from its
        // edge to 1.316 u at 0x40, added, in the shield's colour by level, flashing to the hit
        // colour as its points change and fading back over 30 frames. Its middle is taken
        // as its moby's, 0.75 u above his feet; the game's draw is round his joint 2. Round
        // it, five arcs out from the middle and back (0x341DA0), a grey core of 23 (15 at
        // V3-V4, 48 at V5) in a glow of 14 four times as wide in the level's edge colour,
        // fading from 0x20 over 3-45 frames and laid anew; and four trails of 20 places
        // orbiting it 6° a frame (10° at V5) at about 1 u (0x342478), a grey core fading in
        // from the tail to 0x20 in a glow of stretched quads in the shell's colour, of 44
        // (15, 48). Not drawn: the two sparkles at each trail's head and V3's glow. The
        // Tesla Barrier's bolts are the defaults'.
